{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"plan\": \"先写靠近时的试探，再写亲近逐渐加深、心意被看见后的不安，以及重新放松后想要互相陪伴的愿望。中后段让“还想靠近”逐渐变成“害怕失去”，同时保留幸福与难过并存的感觉。前后呼应“没退开”“舍不得”“悬着”“落稳”：开头不敢多露，结尾不再藏回去。feel按珠子顺序拆成短碎片，同一珠子的体验连续呈现，不把不同听法合并成句子。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他忽然发现自己很想靠近，心里一下热起来。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"很想靠近\", \"热起来\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"炽热\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"响亮和弦\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"来得突然\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像烟花升起\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"直冲高处\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"细碎光点\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"慢慢飘落\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"落下还没稳\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"悬在水面上\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"船歌还没摇稳\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他怕显得太需要，只敢露出一点喜欢。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"太需要\", \"一点喜欢\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"话到嘴边\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默几秒\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想了很久\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里很清楚\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"说出口就不同了\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"格外谨慎\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"这点亲近已让他觉得甜，下次还敢更坦白吗？\",\n          \"keys\": [\"觉得甜\", \"更坦白\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"脚刚踏上船板\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"木板微晃\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波荡开\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体一瞬失重\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"脚下没踩实\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没安稳摇起来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"对方没有退开，仍愿意亲近，他才慢慢放松。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"没有退开\", \"慢慢放松\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"一下又一下\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像心跳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像不停的水浪\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"脚下不用踩实\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不再踩实地面\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"交给船底托着\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"舒服地漂着\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暂时不急靠岸\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水一直在流\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"时间也在走\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"肩挨着肩\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"耳边低语\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸贴近\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"体温融在一起\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"相识已久\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不用找话题\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"偶尔望来一眼\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默不紧张\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"夏末湿热\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"温热的风\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"黏在皮肤上\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"潮潮黏黏\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他也想靠得更近，却怕太急弄坏眼下的自在。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"靠得更近\", \"太急\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"柔软的落音\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"温柔的刺\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"甜蜜的确认\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里一点惆怅\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"好还在眼前\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"鼻子一酸\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没失去\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"先有点舍不得\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想让时间慢点\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"歌声忽然上涌\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一下热切起来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸跟着变了\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没有冲向高潮\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"轻轻呼出口气\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"重新柔和\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"短暂落稳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"又漂起来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心事没说死\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"两人待得越好，他越想到这一刻总会过去。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"待得越好\", \"总会过去\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-3\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他难得不再琢磨以后，只想舒服地待在亲近里。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"不再琢磨以后\", \"待在亲近里\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"歌声退到后面\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"流动盘旋\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波摇曳\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体晃着\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"轻轻漂浮\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暂时不去哪里\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"说过的话还在\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有点陶醉\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有点走神\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默不尴尬\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心慢慢漂远\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"短促急切\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"念头冒出来\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"急着表达\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"很快沉下去\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没变成倾诉\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他想说喜欢，也想问对方是否一样，念头却淡了。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"说喜欢\", \"念头却淡了\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"水波还在晃\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"流动受牵绊\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暗流拖住\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"音乐绕远\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"声音挂半途\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"倒影被风吹碎\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"闪烁却拼不齐\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"谈话碰到心结\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"顺畅里有阻力\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"熟悉的亲近又回来，他想起上次没说出口的话。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"熟悉的亲近\", \"没说出口\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"欢喜\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"熟悉的歌声回来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸挨着\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"比上回更华丽\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"也更迫切\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"细密花腔\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水面光斑\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"晃得睁不开眼\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"微笑着讲往事\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"语速忽然变了\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忍不住再说一遍\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"折回来补细节\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"这回他几乎想把心意全说出来，也盼对方回应。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"全说出来\", \"盼对方回应\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"炽热\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"高处长颤音\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"最后一道金光\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"亮得刺眼\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"情绪烧到最热\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想说最深的情意\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"喉咙发颤\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"话堵在喉咙口\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"右手悬在高处\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波仍往前推\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"情绪一下打开\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越往上越收弱\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没有稳稳落下\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"摇晃慢下来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"话还在回响\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"人安静下来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"34\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"握着手不放\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越握越紧\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没察觉害怕\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"手先露了心\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想抱紧对方\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越用力越颠簸\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"船里失去平衡\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"甜得鼻子发酸\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"两道声线贴近\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波一直向前\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"每秒都在倒数\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没失去\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"已经舍不得\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"歌声越美\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越想多留一会儿\", \"bead\": \"S04-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"可他怕说得太多，让对方为难，也弄丢原有自在。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"说得太多\", \"弄丢原有自在\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-3\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"这回他忘了藏喜欢，对方终于看出他有多在乎。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"忘了藏喜欢\", \"多在乎\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"炽热\",\n          \"from\": [\"S05-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \